<xt>
  <head>
    <!-- Layout template: in-game HUD, 1280 x 720 (docs/design/30-ui-project.md 30.2 class 4).
         Anchored corners are the norm (about 80 % of surveyed HUD screens,
         docs/reference/ui-survey-2026-09/report.md). Typical content per anchor:
           TopLeft      health / resources (RPG, action), objective tracker
           TopCenter    compass strip, boss bar
           TopRight     minimap, score / timer, notifications
           Center       crosshair, hit marker, damage numbers
           LowCenter    interaction prompt, subtitles
           BottomLeft   health (shooter), quick slots (souls-like)
           BottomCenter hotbar / skills
           BottomRight  weapon and ammo, abilities with cooldowns
         Floating elements keep the safe margin (2.5 %, 5 % on console); edge-docked bars may
         touch the edge. Replace the guide boxes with standard symbols. -->
    <style>
      body { width: 100vw; height: 100vh; font-family: var(--font-family); }
      #Screen { position: relative; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }
      .anchor {
        position: absolute;
        display: flex;
        border-width: var(--border-w);
        border-color: var(--color-border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-s);
      }
      .guide { color: var(--color-text-dim); font-size: var(--font-size-xs); padding: var(--space-1); }
      #TopLeft { left: var(--safe-x); top: var(--safe-y); width: 300px; height: 120px; }
      #TopCenter { left: 460px; top: var(--safe-y); width: 360px; height: 40px; }
      #TopRight { right: var(--safe-x); top: var(--safe-y); width: 200px; height: 200px; }
      #Center { left: 600px; top: 320px; width: 80px; height: 80px; }
      #LowCenter { left: 320px; top: 500px; width: 640px; height: 90px; }
      #BottomLeft { left: var(--safe-x); bottom: var(--safe-y); width: 240px; height: 80px; }
      #BottomCenter { left: 462px; bottom: var(--safe-y); width: 356px; height: 64px; }
      #BottomRight { right: var(--safe-x); bottom: var(--safe-y); width: 240px; height: 100px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="Screen">
      <div id="TopLeft" class="anchor"><span id="TopLeftGuide" class="guide">TopLeft</span></div>
      <div id="TopCenter" class="anchor"><span id="TopCenterGuide" class="guide">TopCenter</span></div>
      <div id="TopRight" class="anchor"><span id="TopRightGuide" class="guide">TopRight</span></div>
      <div id="Center" class="anchor"><span id="CenterGuide" class="guide">Center</span></div>
      <div id="LowCenter" class="anchor"><span id="LowCenterGuide" class="guide">LowCenter</span></div>
      <div id="BottomLeft" class="anchor"><span id="BottomLeftGuide" class="guide">BottomLeft</span></div>
      <div id="BottomCenter" class="anchor"><span id="BottomCenterGuide" class="guide">BottomCenter</span></div>
      <div id="BottomRight" class="anchor"><span id="BottomRightGuide" class="guide">BottomRight</span></div>
    </div>
  </body>
</xt>
